      "text": "Anyone may submit a signed call: paying authorises nothing · the key rotates, and PQAdmin names the team's address, not a key, so nothing changes\nFound and handed over: an owner (two-step too) · a ProxyAdmin or EIP-1967 admin · a beacon · every AccessControl role · an AccessManager's admin role",
